  "system": {
    "description": "<p><em>(Coyote, Hyena, Wolf, etc)</em><br><strong>Brawn</strong> +2 <strong>Evasion</strong> +1</p>\n<p><strong>ATK:</strong> Melee Brawn d8+2 phy</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Gain Advantage on</strong>: attack, sprint, track</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<p><strong>Hobbling Strike</strong>: When you succeed on an attack against a target within Melee range, you can <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to make the target temporarily Vulnerable.</p>\n<p><strong>Pack Hunting</strong>: When you succeed on an attack against the same target as an ally who has hit the target immediately before you, add a d8 to your damage roll.</p>\n<p><strong>Sturdy</strong>: When you take Severe+ damage, you drop out of Beastform.</p>\n",
